<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>오늘 먹을 저녁 메뉴 추천 (저메추)</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
    <!-- Google Fonts -->
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Gowun+Dodum&family=Jua&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <header>
            <span class="badge">오늘 뭐 먹지? 🤔</span>
            <h1>오늘 먹을 저녁 메뉴 추천</h1>
            <p class="subtitle">결정 장애를 위한 최고의 저녁 메뉴 랜덤 추천기!</p>
        </header>

        <main class="card">
            <div class="display-area">
                <div id="emoji" class="emoji-box">🍳</div>
                <div id="menu-name" class="menu-title">버튼을 눌러주세요!</div>
                <div id="menu-category" class="menu-category">맛있는 저녁이 기다리고 있어요</div>
            </div>

            <button id="recommend-btn" class="btn">
                <span class="btn-icon">🎲</span>
                <span class="btn-text">저메추!</span>
            </button>
        </main>

        <footer>
            <p>© 2026 저메추 추천기 | 맛있는 저녁 되세요! ✨</p>
        </footer>
    </div>

    <script src="script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>